  "description": "Thanks to its 500W mid motor that evenly distributes weight, the H-1 Pro Series Compass handles better, pedals more smoothly, produces more torque, and drains less battery than a comparable rear hub motor E-Bike. This electric mountain bike is equipped with a large, mid-mounted display that informs you of your current speed, battery level, odometer, trip distance, trip time, assist level, and more. Secure your ride with customizable password protection and adjust your settings through the iOS/Android compatible H-1 Pro Series app. The front and rear mechanical disc brakes bring Compass to a complete stop quickly and safely while you tear up the trails. Compass has 5 assist levels, so you can tap into the motor’s power for all the help you want when you ride up steep terrain or forgo assistance all together and ride it like a normal bike. Reach speeds of up to 20 mph on this Class 2 E-Bike and ride for up to 51 miles at pedal assist level 5, or 31 miles full-throttle. Get ready to adventure with the H-1 Pro Series Compass.",
